Regression Suites

The Concord reference matrix (33 YAML scenarios) lives with the
runner at <resonance>/suite/concord/, not in this repo. Each file
states what it proves and names the Concord build it was proven
against in its header comment.

Resonance is proprietary and available only to Podomy employees,
so these scenarios run on employee machines and never in public CI.
Build, lint, and run instructions live with the runner docs there.
